# flatpak-builder outputs + cached tooling (regenerated locally, never committed).
# Globbed rather than exact: a build of the manifest AS SUBMITTED needs its own
# output dirs alongside the local one (FIBR-0258), and an OSTree repo left
# untracked is thousands of files in `git status`.
.build*/
.repo*/
.flatpak-builder/
.local-manifest.yaml
.flatpak-pip-generator.py
